OL,3,GNEWSACycle club hopes Tour of Britain
OL,4,Ainspires children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cycling club for children has said it
OL,7,Fhopes more will be inspired to learn to
OL,8,Fride by the visit of the Tour of
OL,9,FBritain Women.
OL,11,FLakeland Sprinters Go Ride meets for
OL,12,Foff-road bike sessions at a karting
OL,13,Ftrack in West Cumbria - near where the
OL,14,Fcycling race route will pass through
OL,15,Flater.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
