OL,3,GNEWSACycle club hopes Tour of Britain
OL,4,Ainspires children
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club said the traffic-free circuit
OL,7,Fat Rowrah was an ideal venue to teach
OL,8,Fpupils as young as three to make the
OL,9,Ftransition from balance bikes to
OL,10,Fpedalling, before learning skills such
OL,11,Fas bike handling and riding safely
OL,12,Fclose to other people.
OL,14,FFormer racer Esther Livesey, whose
OL,15,Fchildren have been attending the club
OL,16,Fsince they were toddlers, said the
OL,17,Fyoungsters "can't wait" for the race to
OL,18,Fpass through the county.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
